      <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300">
        <p>
          Capgo Cloud is <strong class="text-white">not</strong> currently presented as a HIPAA-compliant hosted statistics processor per
          <a class="text-cyan-200 underline-offset-4 hover:text-white hover:underline" href={doc('docs/live-updates/hipaa-compliance/')}>
            HIPAA compliance documentation
          </a>
          . Enterprise plans can include a Business Associate Agreement (BAA) for healthcare customers per the
          <a class="text-cyan-200 underline-offset-4 hover:text-white hover:underline" href={doc('hipaa-compliance/')}>
            HIPAA compliance page
          </a>
          .
        </p>
        <p>
          Deployment options for stricter reviews include EU endpoints, disabling explicit statistics (with the limits above), self-hosted statistics, and licensed self-hosting
          (see the HIPAA compliance page).
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

